<title>USA: American Bank sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>American Bank sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WATERBURY, Conn. 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Bank of Connecticut said Friday it set a special dividend of $0.14 a share and a regular quarterly dividend of $0.34 a share on its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>This combined dividend of $0.48 per share is payable December 20 to stockholders of record on December 6, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
